WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.048
Hi! Today we're at a hotel.

2
00:00:06.448 --> 00:00:10.536
You book a room and ask politely.

3
00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:15.529
You need these words at a hotel:

4
00:00:15.929 --> 00:00:19.801
a single room: for one person

5
00:00:20.201 --> 00:00:24.097
a double room: for two people

6
00:00:24.497 --> 00:00:26.905
the reception

7
00:00:27.305 --> 00:00:29.425
the key

8
00:00:29.825 --> 00:00:32.113
with breakfast

9
00:00:32.513 --> 00:00:35.809
The Wi-Fi isn't working.

10
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.932
This is how you book:

11
00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:43.748
I'd like to book a double room.

12
00:00:44.148 --> 00:00:48.452
When? With vom… bis zum:

13
00:00:48.852 --> 00:00:52.196
From the third to the fifth of May.

14
00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:57.052
Polite is: können Sie…?

15
00:00:57.452 --> 00:01:00.100
Can you help me?

16
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.964
Even more polite is: könnten Sie…?

17
00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:07.684
Could you wake me at six?

18
00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:13.584
Listen: Mateo arrives at the hotel.

19
00:01:13.984 --> 00:01:18.840
I have a booking.

20
00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:21.768
What's your name?

21
00:01:22.168 --> 00:01:26.112
Ríos. Mateo Ríos.

22
00:01:26.512 --> 00:01:32.520
Room 214. Here you are.

23
00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.616
When is breakfast?

24
00:01:36.016 --> 00:01:38.976
From seven to ten.

25
00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:49.627
Now you! Call a hotel. Book a room and ask: how much is it?

26
00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:05.469
Great! Now you can:

27
00:02:05.869 --> 00:02:12.549
You book a room and ask very politely. Enjoy your stay!

28
00:02:12.949 --> 00:02:15.069
See you soon!
